  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1704.03 Management Plan Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1704.03 Management Plan Required. The owner of a permit-exempt land application site shall use wood ash received in conformance with a site-specific management plan developed by the certificate holder for that specific site pursuant to Env-Sw 1704.04.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1700); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3404.03); ss by #10601; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
